hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"223","Kufu mein nikah ke bare mein: Hamein Yahya ibn Ma'in ne bayan kiya, hamein Hatim ibn Isma'il ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Hurmuz al-Fadaki ne bayan kiya, Sa'id aur Muhammad ibnay Ubayd se, Abu Hatim al-Muzani se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas aisa shakhs aaye jis ke deen aur akhlaq ko tum pasand karte ho to us se nikah kar do - teen martaba."
"224","Hamein Qutaybah [ibn Sa'id] ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Layth ne bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Abdullah ibn Hurmuz al-Yamani se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne isi tarah farmaya; unhon ne kaha: Logon ne Aap se takrar ki, to Aap ne use teen martaba dohraya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abd al-Hamid ibn Sulayman ne use Ibn Ajlan se muttasil sanad se riwayat kiya hai, aur ye ghalat hai."
"225","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shaybani se, al-Hakam ibn Utaybah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Bilal ko Ansar ke ek gharane ki taraf un se nikah ka paigham de kar bheja, to unhon ne kaha: Ek siyah Habshi ghulam! To Hazrat Bilal ne kaha: Agar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhe tumhare paas aane ka hukm na diya hota to main tumhare paas na aata. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne tumhe hukm diya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Tum malik ban gaye ho. Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas sone ka ek tukda laya gaya to Aap ne woh unhe ata farmaya aur farmaya: Ise apni biwi tak pahuncha do; aur apne Sahaba se farmaya: Apne bhai ke liye us ke walime me jama ho jao."
"226","Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Mughirah se, Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Bilal apne bhai ko le kar Arab ke kuch logon ki taraf us ke liye nikah ka paigham de kar gaye, to unhon ne kaha: Do Habshi ghulam! [To Hazrat Bilal ne kaha: Haan,] hum gumrah thay to Allah ne humein hidayat di, aur hum ghulam thay to Allah - [Azza wa Jalla] - ne humein azad farmaya."
"227","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Mughirah se; unhon ne is ka zikr kiya, Muharib se, unhon ne kaha: Agar tum hum se nikah karo to Alhamdulillah, aur agar tum humein lauta do to Allahu Akbar."
"228","Harun ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, ke Banu Bukayr [Allah ke Rasul] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Hamari behan ka nikah falan shakhs se kar dijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Bilal kyun nahi? Unhon ne baat dohrai to Aap ne teen martaba baat dohrai, phir unhon ne us ka nikah us se kar diya. Unhon ne kaha: Banu Bukayr Banu Layth me se Muhajirin me se thay."
"229","Amr ibn Uthman aur Kathir ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zubaydi ne mujh se bayan kiya; al-Zuhri ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Banu Bayadah ko hukm diya ke woh Abu Hind ka nikah apne me se ek aurat se kar dein, to unhon ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, kya hum apni betiyon ka nikah apne azad kardah ghulamon se kar dein? To Allah - [Azza wa Jalla] - ne nazil farmaya: (Beshak Hum ne tumhe mard aur aurat se paida kiya aur tumhe qaumen aur qabile banaya) - ye ayat. al-Zuhri ne kaha: Ye khaas taur par Abu Hind ke bare me nazil hui. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is ka kuch hissa musnad tariqe se riwayat kiya gaya hai, aur woh zaeef hai."
"230","Isa ibn Yunus al-Tarsusi ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Muslim se, Amr ibn Dinar se: ke Hazrat Bilal ke nikah me ek Quraishi khatun thin."
"231","Ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ki riwayat me Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, ke ek shakhs ne apni beti ka nikah kar diya jabke woh razi na thin, to woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum use napasand karti ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, to Aap ne un ka muamla un ke apne haath me de diya."
